<title>PHILIPPINES: POLL-Philippine firms six months results forecasts.</title>
<headline>POLL-Philippine firms six months results forecasts.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following forecasts are based on polls of Manila-based stock brokerages of their expectations for first half results of the Philippines' leading listed companies. The actual figures are due in the latter half of July.</p>
<p>This table will be published daily, updated with each new company poll.</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>MANILA ELECTRIC CO</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full Year 1997</p>
<p>				(peso billion))</p>
<p>Average forecast    2.84		6.61</p>
<p>Year-ago figure     2.38		5.06</p>
<p>Percentage change + 16.2 %	  + 30.63 %</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>PETRON CORP</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>				(peso billion)</p>
<p>Average forecast    2.27		4.67</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    1.98		4.24</p>
<p>Percentage change +14.65	    + 9.21</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>METRO PACIFIC CORP</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>				(peso million)</p>
<p>Average forecast  494.50	  1,107.00</p>
<p>Year-ago figures  393.16	    843.90</p>
<p>Percentage change +25.76	   + 31.20</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>AYALA LAND INC</p>
<p>			H1 1997    Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion)</p>
<p>Average forecast     2.47	   4.89</p>
<p>Year-ago figures     2.54	   4.01</p>
<p>Percentage change  - 2.75 %     + 18 %</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>SM PRIME HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p>			H1 1997    Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso million)</p>
<p>Average forecast     1,094	  2,416</p>
<p>Year-ago figures	 824	  1,914</p>
<p>Percentage change  + 32.76%     + 26.23%</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>FILINVEST LAND INC</p>
<p>			H1 1997    Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion)</p>
<p> Average forecast    1.18	   2.53</p>
<p> Year-ago figures    1.01	   2.02</p>
<p> Percentage change + 16.8	 + 25.2</p>
<p>				------------</p>
<p>ABS-CBN INC</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso million)</p>
<p>Average forecast    824		 1,803</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    676		 1,530</p>
<p>Percentage change + 21.9	    + 17.84</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>METROPOLITAN BANK &amp; TRUST CO</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion)</p>
<p>Average forecast    2.68		6.63</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    2.034	     5.002</p>
<p>Percentage change + 31.76	   + 32.54</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>AYALA CORP</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion)</p>
<p>Average forecast    3.59		7.03</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    3.45		6.23</p>
<p>Percentage change + 4.06	    + 12.84</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>SAN MIGUEL CORP</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion)</p>
<p>Average forecast    2.40		6.01</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    2.41		5.26</p>
<p>Percentage change - 0.41	    + 14.26</p>
<p>(Note: Since the poll was done, analysts have changed their forecasts for full year. Revised numbers will be posted soon as all contributors have sent in their new forecasts)</p>
